WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:27.120
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:27.390 --> 01:34.920
[The Great Long March]

3
01:35.320 --> 01:37.789
[Episode 38]

4
01:38.640 --> 01:40.590
You are the Commander-in-Chief of the entire army.

5
01:40.590 --> 01:43.650
How could the Commander-in-Chief's matters be minor?

6
01:44.550 --> 01:45.350
Come.

7
01:47.150 --> 01:49.009
Thank you, Commander-in-Chief.

8
01:52.280 --> 01:53.150
Give it to me.

9
01:55.140 --> 01:56.340
This plaster

10
01:57.070 --> 01:59.229
needs to be heated properly.

11
02:00.790 --> 02:01.990
Let the guard do it.

12
02:02.380 --> 02:03.230
No need.

13
02:03.710 --> 02:04.710
They don't know how to do it.

14
02:04.710 --> 02:05.310
I'll do it.

15
02:16.140 --> 02:17.030
Yujie (Zhu De).

16
02:17.910 --> 02:19.030
Seeing you today

17
02:19.700 --> 02:21.900
really brings back a flood of emotions.

18
02:22.190 --> 02:24.450
Back then, after the Nanchang Uprising,

19
02:24.750 --> 02:26.420
the uprising army marched south to Guangdong,

20
02:26.420 --> 02:29.630
and Qian Dajun led more than 20,000 men in pursuit.

21
02:29.860 --> 02:32.980
It was you who turned the tide at the critical moment.

22
02:33.420 --> 02:35.510
At Sanheba, you led 3,000 people

23
02:35.720 --> 02:39.180
and held off the pursuing army for three days and three nights.

24
02:40.510 --> 02:42.110
Tell me where it hurts.

25
02:44.070 --> 02:46.600
It hurts the most right here in the lower back.

26
02:47.630 --> 02:48.190
Here?

27
02:49.420 --> 02:51.750
I still remember the situation back then.

28
02:52.030 --> 02:54.790
At that time, you had the spirit

29
02:55.120 --> 02:58.090
of a warrior who marches off to death without looking back.

30
02:58.090 --> 02:59.250
How heroic!

31
03:00.520 --> 03:01.360
At that time,

32
03:01.980 --> 03:02.950
the situation was urgent.

33
03:02.950 --> 03:04.350
I didn't think that much.

34
03:04.710 --> 03:05.980
Alright, give it a try.

35
03:06.000 --> 03:06.560
Okay.

36
03:11.700 --> 03:13.510
Actually, we all thought

37
03:13.530 --> 03:15.130
your troops were gone.

38
03:16.100 --> 03:17.420
But we never expected

39
03:17.440 --> 03:21.040
you to lead the remaining 800 warriors up Jinggang Mountain,

40
03:21.070 --> 03:23.670
which made today's Central Red Army possible.

41
03:23.720 --> 03:26.030
The credit doesn't belong to me, Zhu De, alone.

42
03:26.030 --> 03:28.210
It's the result of all the commanders and fighters of the Red Army

43
03:28.210 --> 03:30.010
uniting and fighting together.

44
03:30.100 --> 03:31.790
Later, after going up Jinggang Mountain

45
03:31.790 --> 03:33.390
and joining forces with Mao,

46
03:33.420 --> 03:37.220
we had the situation where a single spark could start a prairie fire.

47
03:37.660 --> 03:38.420
Now,

48
03:38.540 --> 03:41.660
the 1st and the 4th Front Armies have successfully joined forces.

49
03:41.660 --> 03:43.320
We still need to stress unity,

50
03:43.420 --> 03:44.510
fight together,

51
03:44.820 --> 03:46.820
and push the revolutionary situation to new heights.

52
03:46.820 --> 03:47.310
Right.

53
03:48.070 --> 03:49.470
Unity is very important.

54
03:50.660 --> 03:51.510
How does it feel?

55
03:51.510 --> 03:52.170
Quite good.

56
03:52.790 --> 03:54.120
See, I told you it works.

57
03:54.140 --> 03:55.140
Here, please sit.

58
03:56.540 --> 03:58.200
I don't have much to offer you.

59
03:58.520 --> 03:59.640
Don't be so polite.

60
04:01.540 --> 04:02.260
So,

61
04:03.540 --> 04:06.350
the current military affairs of the Central Red Army

62
04:06.350 --> 04:08.350
are in the charge of Comrade Zedong?

63
04:08.380 --> 04:09.820
During the Zunyi Conference,

64
04:09.820 --> 04:11.170
the Politburo divided the work.

65
04:11.170 --> 04:12.910
Enlai is in charge of military affairs.

66
04:12.910 --> 04:13.540
Mao

67
04:13.650 --> 04:16.310
acts as Enlai's assistant in military affairs.

68
04:16.630 --> 04:18.360
Later, to make command easier,

69
04:18.380 --> 04:20.980
a three-man military command group was set up,

70
04:21.070 --> 04:23.140
with Enlai, Mao,

71
04:23.380 --> 04:25.440
and Comrade Jiaxiang as its members.

72
04:27.840 --> 04:28.700
What about you?

73
04:29.200 --> 04:31.180
I'm already the Chairman of the Central Revolutionary Military Commission

74
04:31.180 --> 04:33.190
and Commander-in-Chief of the Red Army.

75
04:33.190 --> 04:33.820
Right.

76
04:35.550 --> 04:38.510
It seems the Zunyi Conference made big changes.

77
04:39.510 --> 04:40.450
The resolution of the Zunyi Conference

78
04:40.450 --> 04:41.900
was issued to you, wasn't it?

79
04:41.900 --> 04:43.750
Yes, we received it.

80
04:44.310 --> 04:45.340
We support it.

81
04:46.550 --> 04:48.190
Yujie, I know

82
04:48.700 --> 04:51.159
that the Central Red Army has come a long way,

83
04:51.909 --> 04:54.990
facing strong enemies and fighting across thousands of miles.

84
04:54.990 --> 04:56.670
You must have suffered a lot.

85
04:57.580 --> 04:59.780
And the losses must have been heavy too.

86
04:59.870 --> 05:00.670
Yes.

87
05:02.700 --> 05:04.310
When we set out from Jiangxi,

88
05:04.460 --> 05:05.920
we had over 80,000 people.

89
05:06.110 --> 05:07.570
Fighting all the way here,

90
05:08.260 --> 05:09.990
the losses have been too great.

91
05:10.900 --> 05:11.990
How many people are left?

92
05:11.990 --> 05:14.140
Including the Military Commission Column,

93
05:14.140 --> 05:16.140
there are about 10,000 to 20,000 people.

94
05:16.140 --> 05:17.380
Such heavy losses.

95
05:21.870 --> 05:23.020
What about the morale?

96
05:23.020 --> 05:24.080
The morale is fine.

97
05:24.460 --> 05:26.460
The key cadres have been preserved.

98
05:27.780 --> 05:30.510
Everyone's fighting spirit has not diminished.

99
05:30.750 --> 05:31.460
I believe

100
05:31.630 --> 05:33.870
we will grow and expand sooner or later.

101
05:34.700 --> 05:35.430
That's good.

102
05:36.050 --> 05:38.710
How many people does the 4th Front Army have now?

103
05:39.580 --> 05:42.340
Our 4th Front Army has five main forces,

104
05:42.700 --> 05:44.830
plus the directly subordinate units,

105
05:44.890 --> 05:46.190
we have over 100,000 people.

106
05:46.190 --> 05:47.080
That's great.

107
05:48.700 --> 05:50.460
With the comrades of the 4th Front Army here,

108
05:50.460 --> 05:51.990
we are even more confident.

109
05:59.510 --> 06:00.240
Tastes good.

110
06:09.360 --> 06:14.160
[Guandi Temple, Lianghekou, Maogong County, Sichuan]

111
06:11.200 --> 06:13.760
On June 26, 1935,

112
06:14.340 --> 06:16.110
the CPC Central Committee held an enlarged meeting

113
06:16.110 --> 06:17.950
of the Politburo at Lianghekou.

114
06:18.950 --> 06:21.220
Zhou Enlai first gave a report on behalf of the CPC Central Committee

115
06:21.220 --> 06:23.460
and the Central Revolutionary Military Commission.

116
06:22.360 --> 06:24.300
[Zhu De, Chairman of the Central Revolutionary Military Commission; Commander-in-Chief of the Red Army]

117
06:23.900 --> 06:26.260
He reiterated that after the two armies joined forces,

118
06:26.260 --> 06:27.660
the new strategic policy

119
06:27.950 --> 06:30.580
was to concentrate the main forces to attack northward

120
06:30.580 --> 06:34.240
and create the Sichuan-Shaanxi-Gansu revolutionary base area.

121
06:34.350 --> 06:36.480
During the discussion, the attendees

122
06:36.550 --> 06:38.900
all expressed their agreement with this strategic policy

123
06:37.490 --> 06:38.690
[Luofu (Zhang Wentian), Head of the CPC Central Committee]

124
06:38.690 --> 06:39.290
[Wang Jiaxiang, Vice Chairman of the Central Revolutionary Military Commission]

125
06:38.920 --> 06:40.409
proposed by the Central Committee.

126
06:39.290 --> 06:39.890
[Director of the General Political Department of the Chinese Workers' and Peasants' Red Army]

127
06:41.340 --> 06:42.700
On June 28,

128
06:41.510 --> 06:42.950
[Zhou Enlai, Member of the Standing Committee of the CPC Politburo]

129
06:42.950 --> 06:44.400
[Vice Chairman of the Central Revolutionary Military Commission; General Political Commissar of the Chinese Workers' and Peasants' Red Army]

130
06:43.180 --> 06:45.820
the Politburo of the CPC Central Committee officially issued

131
06:45.210 --> 06:47.620
[Mao Zedong, Member of the Standing Committee of the CPC Politburo, Chairman of the Central Executive Committee of the Chinese Soviet Republic]

132
06:45.840 --> 06:47.900
the "Decision of the Politburo of the CPC Central Committee—

133
06:47.900 --> 06:49.580
On the Strategic Policy

134
06:49.420 --> 06:52.220
[Peng Dehuai, Corps Commander of the 3rd Red Army Corps]

135
06:49.580 --> 06:52.120
After the 1st and 4th Front Armies Joined Forces."

136
06:52.120 --> 06:55.159
It decided that all main Red Army forces should rapidly move north,

137
06:54.030 --> 06:55.460
[Liu Bocheng, Chief of the General Staff of the Chinese Workers' and Peasants' Red Army]

138
06:55.260 --> 06:58.390
seize Songpan, and control the area north of Songpan

139
06:55.460 --> 06:56.890
[Lin Boqu, Director of the General Supply Department of the Central Revolutionary Military Commission]

140
06:57.830 --> 07:00.150
[Bo Gu (Qin Bangxian), Member of the Standing Committee of the CPC Central Politburo]

141
06:58.930 --> 07:01.030
in order to lay the foundation for establishing a base area

142
07:01.030 --> 07:02.830
in Sichuan, Shaanxi, and Gansu.

143
07:02.870 --> 07:04.870
This would place China's Soviet movement

144
07:04.870 --> 07:06.070
on a more consolidated

145
07:05.830 --> 07:08.720
[Liu Shaoqi, Alternate Member of the Politburo of the CPC Central Committee; Director of the Political Department of the 3rd Red Army Corps]

146
07:06.100 --> 07:07.770
and broader foundation,

147
07:08.180 --> 07:10.120
so as to strive for victory in the northwestern provinces of China

148
07:10.120 --> 07:12.050
and ultimately nationwide.

149
07:10.200 --> 07:13.300
[Nie Rongzhen, Political Commissar of the 1st Red Army Corps]

150
07:14.580 --> 07:16.320
The "Decision" also emphasized

151
07:16.320 --> 07:18.630
that in order to realize this strategic policy,

152
07:18.630 --> 07:21.380
we must resolutely oppose the tendencies of avoiding war,

153
07:19.170 --> 07:21.550
[Lin Biao, Commander of the 1st Red Army Corps]

154
07:21.410 --> 07:22.610
retreating and fleeing,

155
07:22.610 --> 07:23.990
as well as being conservative, seeking temporary ease,

156
07:22.810 --> 07:24.760
[Zhang Guotao, Member of the Standing Committee of the CPC Politburo; Chairman of the Northwest Revolutionary Military Commission]

157
07:23.990 --> 07:25.450
and remaining stagnant.

158
07:26.380 --> 07:28.700
The vacillation of these right opportunism

159
07:28.700 --> 07:31.070
is the main danger in the current struggle

160
07:31.070 --> 07:32.600
to create a new Soviet area.

161
07:35.460 --> 07:37.020
On June 29,

162
07:37.430 --> 07:40.340
the Standing Committee of the CPC Politburo held a meeting.

163
07:40.340 --> 07:41.470
The meeting decided

164
07:41.750 --> 07:45.790
to add Zhang Guotao as Vice Chairman of the Central Revolutionary Military Commission,

165
07:45.790 --> 07:50.570
Chen Changhao and Xu Xiangqian as members of the Central Revolutionary Military Commission.

166
07:50.570 --> 07:53.780
It also decided to immediately convene a meeting of the Central Revolutionary Military Commission

167
07:53.780 --> 07:56.240
to formulate the "Songpan Campaign Plan."

168
07:59.700 --> 08:00.340
Comrades,

169
08:00.700 --> 08:02.820
now let's invite Comrade Liu Bocheng

170
08:02.940 --> 08:04.200
to report to the Standing Committee

171
08:04.200 --> 08:07.020
on the specific operational plan for the Songpan Campaign.

172
08:07.020 --> 08:07.580
Okay.

173
08:08.340 --> 08:09.900
Leaders and comrades,

174
08:10.190 --> 08:12.070
I will now report to you

175
08:12.140 --> 08:14.470
the details of the Songpan Campaign Plan.

176
08:17.990 --> 08:19.820
The basic task of this campaign

177
08:19.990 --> 08:21.780
is to swiftly, flexibly,

178
08:21.450 --> 08:25.540
[Map of Sichuan, Shaanxi, and Gansu]

179
08:21.900 --> 08:23.230
and resolutely wipe out

180
08:23.340 --> 08:25.700
Hu Zongnan's troops in the Songpan area

181
08:25.990 --> 08:29.060
and control the roads north and northeast of Songpan,

182
08:29.460 --> 08:31.630
so as to facilitate our army's northward development.

183
08:31.630 --> 08:32.559
The specific deployment is:

184
08:32.559 --> 08:35.150
The 1st and 4th Front Armies will be reorganized into

185
08:35.150 --> 08:37.580
three route armies—the Left, Central, and Right Route Armies.

186
08:37.580 --> 08:39.909
The Left Route Army consists of 16 regiments,

187
08:39.909 --> 08:41.070
with Lin Biao as Commander,

188
08:41.070 --> 08:42.789
Peng Dehuai as Deputy Commander,

189
08:42.789 --> 08:44.740
and Nie Rongzhen as Political Commissar.

190
08:44.740 --> 08:46.670
The Central Route Army consists of 10 regiments,

191
08:46.670 --> 08:50.550
with Xu Xiangqian as Commander and Political Commissar.

192
08:53.960 --> 08:55.700
The Right Route Army consists of 8 regiments,

193
08:55.700 --> 08:59.430
with Comrade Chen Changhao as Commander and Political Commissar.

194
08:59.930 --> 09:02.510
The specific operational routes of the three route armies are:

195
09:02.510 --> 09:04.580
The Left and Central Route Armies

196
09:04.950 --> 09:07.670
will advance from Lianghekou and Huangshengguan

197
09:07.670 --> 09:10.600
to outflank and attack the enemy in the Songpan area,

198
09:10.740 --> 09:11.910
seize the initiative to cut off

199
09:11.910 --> 09:14.950
enemy reinforcements from Pingwu and Nanping,

200
09:15.100 --> 09:17.760
and occupy the passage north to southern Gansu.

201
09:17.980 --> 09:19.620
The Right Route Army will split into two columns

202
09:19.620 --> 09:21.740
and advance toward Songpan

203
09:21.910 --> 09:23.500
via the Luhua and Mao'ergai areas,

204
09:23.500 --> 09:26.670
forming a pincer movement against Hu Zongnan's troops.

205
09:29.550 --> 09:31.220
It must be emphasized in particular

206
09:31.220 --> 09:33.460
that to ensure this campaign plan

207
09:33.670 --> 09:35.820
is implemented swiftly and effectively,

208
09:35.820 --> 09:38.740
all three route armies must act immediately.

209
09:38.950 --> 09:41.270
They must cross the Min River

210
09:41.630 --> 09:42.710
before July 3rd

211
09:42.980 --> 09:45.220
and arrive at the designated assembly points

212
09:45.220 --> 09:46.880
in order to launch the attack.

213
09:47.020 --> 09:48.480
That concludes my report.

214
09:53.050 --> 09:54.050
Comrade Guotao,

215
09:54.550 --> 09:55.750
regarding this plan,

216
09:55.950 --> 09:57.750
do you have any different views?

217
10:03.950 --> 10:04.790
None at all.

218
10:06.500 --> 10:07.410
Since there are no objections,

219
10:07.410 --> 10:08.100
we will issue it

220
10:08.100 --> 10:10.090
in the name of the Central Revolutionary Military Commission

221
10:10.090 --> 10:12.270
so that the troops can act as soon as possible.

222
10:12.270 --> 10:12.950
Okay.

223
10:13.980 --> 10:15.100
Bocheng.

224
10:16.670 --> 10:18.230
Drafting such a comprehensive operational plan

225
10:18.230 --> 10:20.620
in such a short time

226
10:21.080 --> 10:22.080
is no simple feat.

227
10:23.280 --> 10:25.610
This was all discussed by the leaders.

228
10:26.150 --> 10:28.210
I merely compiled and organized it.

229
10:29.580 --> 10:30.860
You're too modest.

230
10:31.620 --> 10:33.350
I think our 4th Front Army

231
10:34.150 --> 10:35.610
has a lot to learn from you.

232
10:37.080 --> 10:39.600
This time, Bocheng, Li Fuchun, and other comrades

233
10:39.600 --> 10:43.040
will convey greetings to the 4th Front Army on behalf of the Central Committee.

234
10:43.040 --> 10:45.100
You all can have a good exchange then.

235
10:45.190 --> 10:46.540
Good. Excellent.

236
10:47.740 --> 10:48.670
Leaders.

237
10:48.950 --> 10:50.430
The farewell performance is about to begin.

238
10:50.430 --> 10:52.220
Alright, let's go watch the performance.

239
10:52.220 --> 10:52.600
Let's go.

240
10:52.600 --> 10:54.640
Here, take some potatoes.

241
10:55.100 --> 10:56.310
Comrade Guotao.

242
10:56.820 --> 10:58.000
Put a few potatoes in your pocket.

243
10:58.000 --> 10:59.400
The performance is long.

244
11:00.180 --> 11:01.000
Everyone, take some.

245
11:01.000 --> 11:02.200
They're all roasted.

246
11:09.310 --> 11:10.100
Delicious.

247
11:11.070 --> 11:11.600
Let's go.

248
11:12.070 --> 11:12.600
Let's go.

249
11:13.550 --> 11:14.080
Alright.

250
11:16.560 --> 11:19.010
[The 1st and the 4th Front Armies unite to support the CPC Central Committee]

251
11:17.950 --> 11:19.980
The Generalissimo's job is really hard.

252
11:19.980 --> 11:21.790
Pounding the table and cursing every day,

253
11:21.790 --> 11:23.500
forcing smiles at the Japanese army,

254
11:23.500 --> 11:25.390
yet he still can't catch the Red Army.

255
11:25.390 --> 11:28.030
Who on earth can come and help him out?

256
11:28.150 --> 11:31.500
Good! Good!

257
11:31.860 --> 11:33.620
Xue Yue! Xue Yue!

258
11:33.620 --> 11:36.100
Here!

259
11:37.960 --> 11:39.080
Reporting to the Generalissimo,

260
11:39.080 --> 11:40.270
my voice reaches the clouds.

261
11:40.270 --> 11:41.340
The troops have already assembled,

262
11:41.340 --> 11:43.570
ready to set sail at any time.

263
11:45.480 --> 11:46.760
You, Xue Boling,

264
11:46.980 --> 11:48.390
look so ridiculous.

265
11:48.550 --> 11:49.820
Look at your bare feet.

266
11:49.910 --> 11:51.640
Where did your shoes run off to?

267
11:54.430 --> 11:55.550
We move so fast.

268
11:55.620 --> 11:57.880
The shoes couldn't keep up with the feet.

269
11:59.790 --> 12:01.200
With our Central Army,

270
12:01.350 --> 12:02.980
the Communist Army can't escape.

271
12:02.980 --> 12:04.460
Like these bad teeth of mine,

272
12:04.460 --> 12:06.460
they'll all be pulled out together.

273
12:06.840 --> 12:08.560
[Huang Chao, Secretary-General of the Northwest Revolutionary Military Commission and the Sichuan-Shaanxi Provincial Soviet Government]

274
12:12.970 --> 12:15.120
Brothers, give it all you've got!

275
12:15.150 --> 12:17.120
Follow me and charge forward.

276
12:17.150 --> 12:19.150
The Red Army is circling just ahead.

277
12:19.220 --> 12:21.120
Catch them and you'll win merit.

278
12:21.150 --> 12:24.500
And your future will be endless glory.

279
12:25.320 --> 12:27.200
What are you singing?

280
12:29.070 --> 12:32.860
R-R-R-Reporting to the Commander!

281
12:33.100 --> 12:33.620
You…

282
12:33.860 --> 12:35.860
The Communist Army has crossed the Chishui River.

283
12:35.860 --> 12:37.790
They are as fast as flying birds.

284
12:38.500 --> 12:40.700
Report!

285
12:41.670 --> 12:42.720
Reporting to the Commander!

286
12:42.720 --> 12:44.740
The Communist Army crossed the Chishui River again,

287
12:44.740 --> 12:47.910
circling back and forth around Zunyi.

288
12:48.910 --> 12:50.950
Report!

289
12:51.140 --> 12:51.740
Report!

290
12:51.760 --> 12:53.670
The Communist Army is heading to Guiyang.

291
12:53.670 --> 12:55.880
That cursed Chiang has no way to escape.

292
12:57.980 --> 13:01.620
Good! Good! Good!

293
13:01.640 --> 13:04.040
Is he really in trouble?

294
13:04.820 --> 13:06.580
Bad, bad, really bad.

295
13:06.600 --> 13:08.740
They will catch the Generalissimo soon.

296
13:08.740 --> 13:10.740
Things aren't looking good for him.

297
13:10.740 --> 13:13.070
If something happens to him, I'm done for.

298
13:14.030 --> 13:15.390
I'm done for.

299
13:24.190 --> 13:26.670
Look at me, running until my legs gave out.

300
13:26.670 --> 13:28.860
Look at me, running until my back broke.

301
13:28.860 --> 13:31.100
But I haven't even seen a shadow of them.

302
13:31.200 --> 13:34.230
Where on earth did the Red Army go?

303
13:38.030 --> 13:40.070
We've reached the banks of the Jinsha River.

304
13:40.070 --> 13:42.260
The river's waves are surging high.

305
13:42.550 --> 13:44.680
We can hardly save our lives this time.

306
13:45.030 --> 13:46.580
Chase them! Find them!

307
13:46.860 --> 13:48.460
I don't believe we can't find the wounded soldiers.

308
13:48.460 --> 13:49.100
Find them!

309
13:49.150 --> 13:50.030
Yes, sir!

310
13:52.460 --> 13:53.860
Can't find them.

311
13:53.950 --> 13:55.150
Can't find them!

312
13:59.660 --> 14:01.430
You're all brainless fools,

313
14:01.670 --> 14:03.740
chasing back and forth, making a mess of it all.

314
14:03.740 --> 14:05.860
If you all had listened to me,

315
14:06.030 --> 14:09.270
we could have wiped out the Red Army long ago.

316
14:09.460 --> 14:14.700
Impossible! Impossible!

317
14:14.720 --> 14:16.670
We are the ones suffering.

318
14:16.700 --> 14:18.860
And here you are, still yelling nonsense.

319
14:18.860 --> 14:20.760
Instead of fighting the Japanese devils,

320
14:20.760 --> 14:22.960
you turn your guns on your own brothers.

321
14:23.340 --> 14:25.000
Look at you, making a fool of yourself.

322
14:25.000 --> 14:27.530
You deserve the toothache and an early death.

323
14:28.910 --> 14:32.740
We're quitting! We're quitting!

324
14:37.340 --> 14:38.310
Mutiny!

325
14:38.580 --> 14:39.340
Mutiny!

326
14:39.340 --> 14:41.700
Total mutiny!

327
14:41.700 --> 14:45.700
Great!

328
14:50.700 --> 14:51.340
Great!

329
14:55.260 --> 14:59.530
[Maoxian, Sichuan]

330
15:02.270 --> 15:03.120
Political Commissar Changhao.

331
15:03.120 --> 15:04.780
Let's carry it out as planned.

332
15:07.620 --> 15:08.430
Your regiment

333
15:08.580 --> 15:10.030
will advance to Songpan

334
15:10.190 --> 15:11.230
via Luhua and Mao'ergai.

335
15:11.230 --> 15:11.870
Yes, sir.

336
15:13.360 --> 15:14.160
Your regiment

337
15:14.340 --> 15:16.220
will advance to Songpan via Songpinggou,

338
15:16.220 --> 15:17.910
Hongtupo, and Xiaoxinggou.

339
15:18.310 --> 15:18.910
Yes, sir.

340
15:20.580 --> 15:21.950
All units must

341
15:21.970 --> 15:23.970
cross the Min River before July 3rd.

342
15:24.030 --> 15:26.390
And after arriving at your respective assembly points,

343
15:26.390 --> 15:28.320
form a pincer attack on Hu Zongnan.

344
15:28.430 --> 15:28.960
Yes, sir.

345
15:30.160 --> 15:31.060
Chairman Zhang is back?

346
15:31.060 --> 15:33.190
Yes. Chairman Zhang hasn't eaten yet.

347
15:54.100 --> 15:54.600
Chairman Zhang.

348
15:54.600 --> 15:55.530
Chairman Zhang.

349
16:00.310 --> 16:01.220
Chairman Zhang.

350
16:01.220 --> 16:02.350
The meeting is over?

351
16:05.340 --> 16:07.940
How's the situation with the Central Red Army?

352
16:08.910 --> 16:09.640
Not good.

353
16:18.800 --> 16:19.770
Do you know?

354
16:20.490 --> 16:21.540
They now

355
16:23.160 --> 16:24.110
only have

356
16:24.500 --> 16:25.960
about 10,000 people left.

357
16:26.220 --> 16:28.220
And there are many sick and wounded.

358
16:28.340 --> 16:29.560
Their combat effectiveness is insufficient.

359
16:29.560 --> 16:32.220
It's not an exaggeration at all to describe them

360
16:32.460 --> 16:33.920
as an utterly routed army.

361
16:33.990 --> 16:35.590
The problem is that serious?

362
16:35.740 --> 16:37.150
What about the Central Committee and the Military Commission?

363
16:37.150 --> 16:38.910
There are serious internal contradictions,

364
16:38.910 --> 16:39.910
and they are not united.

365
16:39.700 --> 16:42.940
[Xu Xiangqian, Commander-in-Chief of the 4th Front Army]

366
16:40.860 --> 16:42.190
That's too surprising.

367
16:42.270 --> 16:43.270
In such a situation,

368
16:42.990 --> 16:46.430
[Chen Changhao, Political Commissar of the 4th Front Army]

369
16:43.460 --> 16:46.520
how can the Songpan Campaign Plan still be carried out?

370
16:47.150 --> 16:48.500
They keep saying

371
16:49.110 --> 16:52.510
that the two front armies will join forces to attack Songpan,

372
16:52.580 --> 16:53.500
but they simply don't have

373
16:53.500 --> 16:54.820
what it takes to fight.

374
16:55.210 --> 16:58.270
In the end, they still have to rely on our 4th Front Army.

375
16:58.460 --> 16:59.150
Even so,

376
17:00.740 --> 17:04.109
the Central Committee still wants to concentrate command authority in the Military Commission.

377
17:04.109 --> 17:04.700
Also,

378
17:05.220 --> 17:06.540
I found out privately

379
17:06.829 --> 17:08.010
that the Zunyi Conference

380
17:08.010 --> 17:11.060
only partially solved the military command problem,

381
17:11.510 --> 17:14.430
but did not solve the Central Committee's line problem.

382
17:14.430 --> 17:16.910
Now Zhang Wentian is Head of the Central Committee,

383
17:16.910 --> 17:18.740
but everywhere I go,

384
17:19.300 --> 17:20.700
all I smell is Mao Zedong.

385
17:22.700 --> 17:24.720
Even regarding the military command problem,

386
17:24.720 --> 17:26.390
they're also wrong.

387
17:26.660 --> 17:28.590
The Central Red Army with 80,000 soldiers

388
17:28.590 --> 17:31.150
was reduced to just over 10,000 people in the end.

389
17:31.150 --> 17:33.150
This is the strongest proof.

390
17:33.460 --> 17:35.190
And take a look at our 4th Front Army.

391
17:35.190 --> 17:36.540
Strong soldiers with sturdy horses.

392
17:36.540 --> 17:37.430
What does this show?

393
17:37.430 --> 17:39.430
It shows that our line is correct.

394
17:40.290 --> 17:41.290
At this rate,

395
17:41.500 --> 17:43.500
won't it be the minority commanding the majority,

396
17:43.500 --> 17:45.500
and the wrong commanding the right?

397
17:46.430 --> 17:47.360
Chairman Zhang,

398
17:47.600 --> 17:50.370
did you raise your thoughts on the Central Committee and the Central Revolutionary Military Commission,

399
17:50.370 --> 17:52.340
as well as your doubts about the Songpan Campaign Plan,

400
17:52.340 --> 17:53.610
at the meeting?

401
17:53.640 --> 17:55.540
Was there any point in raising them?

402
17:55.540 --> 17:56.780
They had so many people

403
17:56.780 --> 17:58.020
that the weight of numbers was on their side.

404
17:58.020 --> 17:59.700
Their spit alone could drown me.

405
17:59.700 --> 18:00.980
Plus, you weren't there.

406
18:00.980 --> 18:03.780
I was all alone and could hardly make a difference.

407
18:06.030 --> 18:07.030
In my opinion,

408
18:07.220 --> 18:09.420
going north to Pingwu and Songpan

409
18:10.150 --> 18:12.190
isn't as good as taking southwest Sichuan first.

410
18:12.190 --> 18:13.120
Chairman Zhang.

411
18:13.120 --> 18:14.870
The troops have already started moving.

412
18:14.870 --> 18:16.500
If we change the operational plan at this point,

413
18:16.500 --> 18:17.910
first, it violates regulations;

414
18:17.910 --> 18:18.870
second, you…

415
18:25.980 --> 18:27.020
What you just said

416
18:27.740 --> 18:29.940
about the southwest region of Sichuan…

417
18:30.020 --> 18:30.820
Look.

418
18:32.350 --> 18:33.810
Right now, the Sichuan Army has already deployed heavy troops

419
18:33.810 --> 18:35.630
to guard the southwest region of Sichuan.

420
18:35.630 --> 18:37.150
Moreover, Xue Yue's Central Army

421
18:37.150 --> 18:38.740
has already begun to press northward.

422
18:38.740 --> 18:39.830
Only in the north,

423
18:40.190 --> 18:41.410
Hu Zongnan's troops in the north

424
18:41.410 --> 18:42.740
have not yet finished assembling.

425
18:42.740 --> 18:44.590
Now, with such a large strategic gap

426
18:44.590 --> 18:46.190
between Pingwu and Songpan,

427
18:46.350 --> 18:47.880
it is the best opportunity.

428
18:53.830 --> 18:54.590
Alright.

429
18:55.150 --> 18:56.630
We can attack Songpan first.

430
18:56.630 --> 18:57.260
But

431
18:57.630 --> 18:59.630
the strategic policy of going south

432
19:00.430 --> 19:02.560
still can't be completely abandoned.

433
19:05.640 --> 19:06.370
Also,

434
19:06.820 --> 19:08.540
we can't move troops too fast.

435
19:16.390 --> 19:17.710
Even if we go north,

436
19:20.760 --> 19:23.890
we must first settle the question of command authority.

437
19:41.720 --> 19:43.910
On June 30, 1935,

438
19:44.350 --> 19:46.370
the Central Column, along with the 1st Corps of the Central Red Army

439
19:46.370 --> 19:49.190
and the main force of the 88th Division of the 4th Front Army

440
19:49.190 --> 19:51.590
in Maogong County and the Lianghekou area,

441
19:51.670 --> 19:53.460
crossed the Mengbi Snow Mountain

442
19:53.460 --> 19:56.630
and arrived in the Zhuokeji area on July 1.

443
19:59.640 --> 20:03.310
[Zhuokeji, Lifan County, Sichuan]

444
20:00.970 --> 20:03.460
After the 6th Red Army Corps occupied the Tusi Manor,

445
20:03.460 --> 20:04.660
they issued an order.

446
20:04.870 --> 20:06.220
Nothing here

447
20:06.300 --> 20:07.820
was touched by anyone.

448
20:18.020 --> 20:19.280
I really didn't expect

449
20:19.540 --> 20:20.500
to find "Romance of the Three Kingdoms"

450
20:20.500 --> 20:21.900
in the chieftain's home.

451
20:23.270 --> 20:24.870
The chieftain's name is Suo Guanying.

452
20:24.870 --> 20:26.150
He studied in Chengdu

453
20:26.170 --> 20:27.830
and is proficient in Chinese.

454
20:28.060 --> 20:28.930
I really want to meet

455
20:28.930 --> 20:30.610
this Chieftain Suo Guanying.

456
20:30.830 --> 20:32.380
What a pity. He ran away.

457
20:33.110 --> 20:34.970
He didn't have the courage to meet our Red Army.

458
20:34.970 --> 20:36.700
Not only did the chieftain run away,

459
20:36.700 --> 20:38.110
but all the Tibetans in this area

460
20:38.110 --> 20:39.360
have hidden in the mountains.

461
20:39.360 --> 20:41.880
No matter how the soldiers called out to them, they wouldn't come back.

462
20:41.880 --> 20:43.940
They've even hidden their grain too.

463
20:44.220 --> 20:44.950
It seems

464
20:45.630 --> 20:47.700
the Kuomintang has said a lot of bad things about us.

465
20:47.700 --> 20:48.700
In the short term,

466
20:48.970 --> 20:50.260
it will be hard to change.

467
20:50.260 --> 20:52.990
Plus, this place is vast and sparsely populated.

468
20:53.150 --> 20:55.390
If we want to mobilize the masses and collect grain,

469
20:55.390 --> 20:57.110
I'm afraid it will be even more difficult.

470
20:57.110 --> 20:59.020
So, we can't stop.

471
20:59.980 --> 21:01.350
We must carry out

472
21:01.440 --> 21:03.460
the Songpan Campaign Plan as soon as possible

473
21:03.460 --> 21:05.460
and move north to seek development.

474
21:05.910 --> 21:07.260
Okay. Here.

475
21:07.810 --> 21:08.360
Here.

476
21:08.680 --> 21:11.630
If everything had gone according to the established plan of the campaign,

477
21:11.630 --> 21:12.700
the three columns

478
21:12.980 --> 21:14.910
should have already crossed the Min River

479
21:14.910 --> 21:16.180
and reached their designated positions.

480
21:16.180 --> 21:17.220
But now,

481
21:17.430 --> 21:19.870
the 1st Front Army is all fired up,

482
21:19.940 --> 21:22.200
while the 4th Front Army just won't move.

483
21:23.110 --> 21:24.590
The Songpan Campaign Plan

484
21:24.810 --> 21:27.340
was a decision made at the Politburo meeting.

485
21:27.740 --> 21:29.550
Zhang Guotao raised his hand for it.

486
21:29.550 --> 21:32.110
I don't believe he would go back on his word.

487
21:32.420 --> 21:34.430
A few days ago at the meeting in Lianghekou,

488
21:34.430 --> 21:36.110
I saw he looked quite modest.

489
21:36.430 --> 21:38.160
I thought I misunderstood him.

490
21:38.190 --> 21:39.060
But now it seems

491
21:39.430 --> 21:41.350
he says one thing to your face and does another behind your back.

492
21:41.350 --> 21:43.300
During the Lianghekou Conference,

493
21:43.300 --> 21:45.220
he asked around about the Zunyi Conference

494
21:45.220 --> 21:46.680
and the Huili Conference.

495
21:46.870 --> 21:47.870
He even came to me.

496
21:48.260 --> 21:48.920
Privately,

497
21:49.110 --> 21:51.450
he also found some cadres of the 1st Front Army

498
21:51.450 --> 21:52.390
to communicate with.

499
21:52.390 --> 21:54.560
He had a strong intention to win them over.

500
21:54.560 --> 21:55.040
Right.

501
21:55.540 --> 21:57.350
Comrade Bocheng sent a telegram saying

502
21:57.350 --> 21:59.500
they didn't go to Maoxian at all.

503
21:59.700 --> 22:01.190
Instead, Zhang Guotao arranged for them to stay

504
22:01.190 --> 22:02.540
at the headquarters of the 4th Front Army

505
22:02.540 --> 22:04.170
in Zagunao.

506
22:04.670 --> 22:06.740
Even when eating and walking,

507
22:07.110 --> 22:08.530
they are monitored by special personnel.

508
22:08.530 --> 22:09.850
They are not allowed

509
22:10.220 --> 22:12.060
to contact the commanders and fighters of the 4th Front Army,

510
22:12.060 --> 22:13.110
let alone

511
22:13.300 --> 22:14.780
follow the orders of the Central Committee

512
22:14.780 --> 22:16.700
to convey the spirit of the Lianghekou Conference.

513
22:16.700 --> 22:17.960
What is he monitoring?

514
22:18.420 --> 22:19.500
What does he want to do?

515
22:19.500 --> 22:22.390
This is a serious violation of organizational discipline.

516
22:22.390 --> 22:23.650
It must not be allowed.

517
22:24.220 --> 22:26.950
It's too early to draw a conclusion about him now.

518
22:27.740 --> 22:28.300
Enlai,

519
22:29.210 --> 22:31.670
is there any new telegram from Zhang Guotao?

520
22:32.270 --> 22:32.870
No.

521
22:33.460 --> 22:35.260
In the telegram this afternoon,

522
22:35.590 --> 22:36.980
he emphasized again

523
22:37.110 --> 22:40.050
that the organizational problem of command must be solved as soon as possible.

524
22:40.050 --> 22:41.740
But regarding the plan for the Songpan Campaign,

525
22:41.740 --> 22:43.140
he didn't mention a word.

526
22:43.390 --> 22:46.150
Haven't we already passed a resolution in the Standing Committee

527
22:46.150 --> 22:49.020
to add Zhang Guotao as Vice Chairman of the Military Commission,

528
22:49.020 --> 22:50.700
and Chen Changhao and Xu Xiangqian

529
22:50.700 --> 22:51.980
as members of the Military Commission?

530
22:51.980 --> 22:53.980
The Central Route Army and the Right Route Army

531
22:53.980 --> 22:56.060
are also led by comrades from the 4th Front Army

532
22:56.060 --> 22:58.630
serving as Commanders and Political Commissars.

533
22:58.630 --> 22:59.890
What else does he want?

534
23:03.870 --> 23:05.420
He wants more power.

535
23:06.540 --> 23:07.270
Ultimately,

536
23:07.780 --> 23:09.460
he relies on his strong army,

537
23:09.500 --> 23:11.300
and seeing our Central Red Army,

538
23:11.700 --> 23:12.980
he finds it too shabby.

539
23:14.480 --> 23:15.540
He looks down on us.

540
23:17.240 --> 23:18.700
Why does he look down on us?

541
23:18.950 --> 23:20.810
What right does he have to do that?

542
23:21.220 --> 23:22.400
The 4th Front Army is now

543
23:22.400 --> 23:23.910
strong and powerful.

544
23:24.460 --> 23:26.430
But whose army is the 4th Front Army?

545
23:26.430 --> 23:27.590
It's the Party's army!

546
23:27.590 --> 23:29.350
It's not Zhang Guotao's private army!

547
23:29.350 --> 23:30.750
It doesn't belong to him!

548
23:30.910 --> 23:32.640
If he really has this ambition,

549
23:32.870 --> 23:35.300
we must resolutely fight him to the end!

550
23:35.340 --> 23:36.430
We must fight to the end!

551
23:36.430 --> 23:37.430
Fight to the end!

552
23:38.430 --> 23:40.350
Comrades, we must fight,

553
23:40.710 --> 23:42.540
but we must also pay attention to methods.

554
23:42.540 --> 23:44.260
Our biggest contradiction at present

555
23:44.260 --> 23:45.640
is still the contradiction between the enemy and us.

556
23:45.640 --> 23:48.440
Resolutely implementing the Songpan combat plan

557
23:48.600 --> 23:50.600
and seeking a way out for the Red Army

558
23:51.630 --> 23:53.350
is our top priority.

559
23:53.870 --> 23:55.000
Under this premise,

560
23:55.300 --> 23:57.390
we still have to do our best

561
23:57.850 --> 23:59.160
to unite Zhang Guotao

562
24:00.190 --> 24:02.190
and the comrades of the 4th Front Army.

563
24:02.190 --> 24:02.950
I think

564
24:04.020 --> 24:06.630
we should send a telegram to Comrade Li Fuchun,

565
24:07.150 --> 24:09.410
asking him to go to Zhang Guotao in person

566
24:09.430 --> 24:13.030
to urge the 4th Front Army to dispatch troops as soon as possible.

567
24:14.260 --> 24:14.840
Enlai,

568
24:16.220 --> 24:17.110
are you okay?

569
24:18.620 --> 24:19.350
I'm fine.

570
24:19.350 --> 24:21.190
I'll contact Comrade Fuchun right now

571
24:21.190 --> 24:23.120
and ask him to find Comrade Guotao.

572
24:50.020 --> 24:54.960
[Zagunao, Lifan County, Sichuan]

573
24:53.260 --> 24:54.300
Comrade Guotao.

574
24:55.730 --> 24:57.390
Comrade Fuchun, you're here.

575
24:58.540 --> 24:59.190
Well,

576
24:59.350 --> 25:01.190
does the Central Committee have any new instructions?

577
25:01.190 --> 25:02.590
The Central Committee hopes the 4th Front Army

578
25:02.460 --> 25:06.200
[Li Fuchun, representative director of the Red Army General Political Department]

579
25:02.670 --> 25:04.260
will follow the Songpan Campaign Plan

580
25:04.260 --> 25:05.500
and mobilize troops in time

581
25:05.500 --> 25:07.960
so as not to miss the opportunity for battle.

582
25:09.980 --> 25:11.270
Don't just stand there.

583
25:11.270 --> 25:11.930
Have a seat.

584
25:11.940 --> 25:12.790
I won't sit.

585
25:12.820 --> 25:15.680
The Central Committee is still waiting for a reply.

586
25:26.160 --> 25:27.090
Comrade Fuchun.

587
25:28.870 --> 25:29.870
I think

588
25:30.590 --> 25:31.790
there are some things

589
25:36.330 --> 25:38.060
we need to settle first.

590
25:38.840 --> 25:40.720
Feel free to talk about anything.

591
25:45.500 --> 25:46.350
Look,

592
25:47.260 --> 25:49.590
after the two front armies joined forces,

593
25:50.220 --> 25:51.880
this is just too big to handle.

594
25:52.670 --> 25:53.590
I think

595
25:53.740 --> 25:55.460
we still need to solve

596
25:55.730 --> 25:59.330
the organizational problem of unified military command first.

597
25:59.920 --> 26:00.970
Comrade Guotao,

598
26:01.740 --> 26:02.810
wasn't this problem

599
26:02.810 --> 26:04.960
already solved

600
26:05.210 --> 26:07.540
at the Lianghekou Politburo Conference?

601
26:07.860 --> 26:08.820
Solved?

602
26:12.220 --> 26:15.190
Do you think adding the names of me,

603
26:16.290 --> 26:18.920
Xu Xiangqian, and Chen Changhao

604
26:19.190 --> 26:21.120
to the Military Commission's list

605
26:21.700 --> 26:22.870
solves the problem?

606
26:23.840 --> 26:25.930
That's a bit too simple

607
26:25.950 --> 26:27.080
and hasty, isn't it?

608
26:30.040 --> 26:30.970
Comrade Guotao,

609
26:30.980 --> 26:33.710
if you have any opinions, just say them directly.

610
26:36.870 --> 26:39.480
I suggest the Central Committee readjust

611
26:39.500 --> 26:42.300
the organizational structure of the Red Army General Headquarters.

612
26:42.300 --> 26:45.700
Xu Xiangqian should be the Deputy Commander-in-Chief of the Red Army,

613
26:45.700 --> 26:49.460
and Chen Changhao should be the General Political Commissar of the Red Army.

614
26:49.460 --> 26:52.700
Comrade Chen Changhao as the General Political Commissar of the Red Army?

615
26:52.700 --> 26:53.500
Yes.

616
26:54.800 --> 26:56.310
What about Comrade Zhou Enlai?

617
26:56.310 --> 26:58.590
The Military Commission can set up a Standing Committee.

618
26:58.590 --> 27:00.720
People like Mao Zedong and Zhou Enlai,

619
27:00.830 --> 27:02.520
as members of the Standing Committee,

620
27:02.520 --> 27:05.700
would be specifically responsible for planning strategic guidelines,

621
27:05.700 --> 27:08.630
but would not directly participate in campaign command.

622
27:08.630 --> 27:10.390
Specific military commands

623
27:10.630 --> 27:13.150
would be issued by the Red Army General Headquarters.

624
27:13.150 --> 27:13.780
Look,

625
27:13.860 --> 27:15.410
wouldn't this reflect

626
27:15.430 --> 27:17.630
a unified military command?

627
27:21.060 --> 27:22.000
Comrade Guotao,

628
27:22.910 --> 27:24.870
I roughly understand what you mean.

629
27:24.870 --> 27:26.160
But this is a matter of great importance.

630
27:26.160 --> 27:29.160
I have to ask the Central Committee for instructions.

631
27:30.820 --> 27:33.320
Then you'd better ask for instructions quickly,

632
27:33.320 --> 27:36.190
so as not to affect the troops' next move.

633
27:36.430 --> 27:38.630
That would delay military operations.

634
27:38.780 --> 27:39.670
Okay.

635
27:44.500 --> 27:46.160
You're not drinking your tea?

636
27:46.670 --> 27:47.870
I won't drink the tea.

637
27:48.210 --> 27:51.470
I'll quickly ask the Central Committee for instructions.

638
28:08.260 --> 28:09.730
Is it a telegram from Li Fuchun?

639
28:09.730 --> 28:11.530
It's a telegram from Lin and Nie.

640
28:21.770 --> 28:23.780
The pathfinding detachment of the 1st Red Army Corps

641
28:23.780 --> 28:26.060
encountered more than 2,000 cavalrymen

642
28:26.080 --> 28:27.980
of the Qinghai warlord in the Longriba area.

643
28:27.980 --> 28:29.540
After more than two hours of fierce fighting,

644
28:29.540 --> 28:32.000
although they repelled the enemy's attack,

645
28:32.270 --> 28:33.590
they had to retreat.

646
28:34.350 --> 28:35.540
Retreat? Why?

647
28:35.870 --> 28:36.980
Food shortage.

648
28:37.300 --> 28:38.700
The soldiers simply don't have

649
28:38.700 --> 28:40.350
the physical strength to fight the enemy.

650
28:40.350 --> 28:44.550
It seems the route through the grasslands is very difficult to get through.

651
28:45.150 --> 28:46.870
If we can't get through the grasslands,

652
28:46.870 --> 28:48.470
quickly taking down Songpan

653
28:49.020 --> 28:50.500
is the only way to go north.

654
28:50.870 --> 28:52.470
Lin Biao said in the telegram

655
28:53.110 --> 28:54.180
that no main force of Hu Zongnan's troops

656
28:54.180 --> 28:55.950
was found in the Mao'ergai area.

657
28:55.950 --> 28:57.040
He suggested the Left Route Army

658
28:57.040 --> 28:58.790
advance from Luhua and Heishui

659
28:58.820 --> 29:00.020
to take Mao'ergai.

660
29:04.830 --> 29:05.500
Why not

661
29:05.830 --> 29:06.700
have the Left Route

662
29:06.700 --> 29:07.670
and Central Route Armies

663
29:07.670 --> 29:08.500
merge,

664
29:08.860 --> 29:11.150
and swiftly thrust from Heishui to Mao'ergai?

665
29:11.150 --> 29:13.540
Our Military Commission Column will also advance from Zhuokeji

666
29:13.540 --> 29:15.200
towards the Upper Luhua area.

667
29:22.580 --> 29:23.130
Agreed.

668
29:25.830 --> 29:26.390
Agreed.

669
29:27.150 --> 29:28.480
We can't delay anymore.

670
29:28.590 --> 29:29.720
If we keep delaying,

671
29:29.830 --> 29:31.870
even if we are not surrounded by the enemy,

672
29:31.870 --> 29:33.200
we will starve to death.

673
29:38.030 --> 29:38.750
Report.

674
29:39.300 --> 29:41.560
Urgent telegram from Comrade Li Fuchun.

675
30:05.290 --> 30:07.570
Zhang Guotao openly proposed

676
30:07.770 --> 30:10.500
that Xu Xiangqian serve as Deputy Commander-in-Chief of the Red Army,

677
30:10.500 --> 30:12.980
and Chen Changhao as General Political Commissar of the Red Army.

678
30:12.980 --> 30:15.350
He demanded that Comrades Enlai and Zedong

679
30:15.350 --> 30:17.020
withdraw from military command,

680
30:17.020 --> 30:18.980
only serving as members of the Military Commission's Standing Committee,

681
30:18.980 --> 30:21.640
responsible for formulating strategic plans.

682
30:22.270 --> 30:23.350
Outrageous!

683
30:23.840 --> 30:26.370
Since the founding of the Communist Party of China,

684
30:26.370 --> 30:28.030
this is the first time someone

685
30:28.300 --> 30:31.440
has reached out to demand power from the Central Committee!

686
30:31.440 --> 30:33.370
Comrade Fuchun also reported that

687
30:33.630 --> 30:35.650
Zhang Guotao has been constantly spreading

688
30:35.650 --> 30:37.150
news unfavorable to the Central Committee,

689
30:37.150 --> 30:39.150
claiming that the Zunyi Conference

690
30:39.460 --> 30:41.500
only solved the problem of military command,

691
30:41.500 --> 30:42.350
but did not solve

692
30:42.350 --> 30:44.700
the Central Committee's organizational line problem.

693
30:44.700 --> 30:48.300
He even said the Zunyi Conference was a mistake.

694
30:48.430 --> 30:51.690
He is not just demanding power from the Central Committee.

695
30:51.980 --> 30:54.080
He wants to change the Central Committee's line!

696
30:54.080 --> 30:57.480
He is openly denying the resolution of the Zunyi Conference.

697
30:57.700 --> 31:00.060
We can no longer let him do as he pleases!

698
31:05.060 --> 31:05.780
Comrades.

699
31:06.420 --> 31:08.220
We must have enough principles,

700
31:08.420 --> 31:11.420
but we also need enough endurance

701
31:11.940 --> 31:13.180
and enough patience

702
31:13.480 --> 31:15.280
to get through this difficulty.

703
31:15.430 --> 31:16.060
But...

704
31:16.430 --> 31:18.390
How do we reply to Zhang Guotao?

705
31:19.220 --> 31:20.190
Don't reply for now.

706
31:20.190 --> 31:21.450
Issue orders as usual.

707
31:22.740 --> 31:25.940
We must let Zhang Guotao know our strategic determination.

708
31:25.940 --> 31:28.600
Everything else can wait until we take Songpan.

709
32:06.590 --> 32:07.300
Come in.

710
32:11.110 --> 32:11.870
Chairman,

711
32:12.620 --> 32:15.280
urgent telegram from the Military Commission.

712
32:22.460 --> 32:23.580
Is this the only one?

713
32:23.580 --> 32:23.990
Yes,

714
32:24.270 --> 32:25.800
this is the only one for now.

715
32:29.430 --> 32:29.980
Reply.

716
32:33.110 --> 32:35.540
We will execute the orders of the Central Military Commission.

717
32:35.540 --> 32:39.740
The Central Route Army will immediately move closer to the Left Route Army.

718
32:41.830 --> 32:43.020
Move closer first.

719
32:43.590 --> 32:45.920
We can't let them use anything against us.

720
32:46.190 --> 32:47.590
As for what happens next,

721
32:49.060 --> 32:51.060
that will depend on their attitude.

722
32:52.700 --> 32:53.390
Yes.

723
33:02.750 --> 33:04.350
You go to the Left Route Army.

724
33:06.030 --> 33:11.810
[Chengdu, Sichuan]

725
33:07.540 --> 33:09.190
A telegram from Commander He Yingqin.

726
33:09.190 --> 33:10.500
He officially signed the reply letter on July 6th,

727
33:10.500 --> 33:12.030
agreeing to all the demands

728
33:12.060 --> 33:14.210
of Yoshijiro Umezu, commander

729
33:14.230 --> 33:16.060
of the Japanese Garrison Army in China.

730
33:16.060 --> 33:16.830
He agreed...

731
33:16.850 --> 33:17.910
Alright! Alright!

732
33:18.250 --> 33:19.180
Generalissimo,

733
33:19.430 --> 33:21.290
although we are currently humiliated by the Japanese,

734
33:21.290 --> 33:22.680
our relations with Japan

735
33:22.680 --> 33:24.390
is relatively relaxed during this period.

736
33:24.390 --> 33:27.240
It is a great opportunity to eliminate the Communist Army and pacify the country.

737
33:27.240 --> 33:28.480
As for the Japanese,

738
33:28.680 --> 33:30.020
we can only bide our time.

739
33:30.020 --> 33:31.380
As for the Communist Army,

740
33:31.380 --> 33:33.670
the sooner we eliminate them,

741
33:34.400 --> 33:37.130
the sooner the country will enjoy great fortune.

742
33:39.700 --> 33:41.830
The signing of the He-Umezu Agreement

743
33:41.870 --> 33:43.220
caused China to lose

744
33:43.220 --> 33:45.020
most of its sovereignty over

745
33:45.020 --> 33:46.680
Peiping, Tianjin, and Hebei.

746
33:47.000 --> 33:49.610
This is an important step for Japan to create a special status for North China

747
33:49.610 --> 33:52.300
and further separate it.

748
33:52.520 --> 33:57.460
[Headquarters of the Red 4th Front Army, Zagunao, Lifan County, Sichuan]

749
34:15.639 --> 34:16.699
Can you believe it?

750
34:18.710 --> 34:19.909
This article

751
34:20.520 --> 34:23.850
was written by Kai Feng, my fellow villager from Pingxiang.

752
34:24.190 --> 34:26.060
Do you think they are criticizing our

753
34:26.060 --> 34:27.860
Northwest Federal Government?

754
34:28.100 --> 34:29.500
I don't think so.

755
34:29.790 --> 34:31.750
They are openly expressing

756
34:31.840 --> 34:34.500
their dissatisfaction with the 4th Front Army!

757
34:34.750 --> 34:35.989
They are publicly

758
34:36.020 --> 34:37.909
criticizing our correct line

759
34:38.230 --> 34:40.070
and trying to completely erase

760
34:40.100 --> 34:41.900
all our previous achievements!

761
34:44.989 --> 34:46.120
If this continues,

762
34:46.350 --> 34:47.659
our 4th Front Army

763
34:49.230 --> 34:50.460
will be gone!

764
34:52.100 --> 34:54.560
We will be swallowed by them sooner or later!

765
35:09.950 --> 35:10.830
I think

766
35:11.100 --> 35:12.890
we should act in the name of the Sichuan-Shaanxi Provincial Party Committee

767
35:12.890 --> 35:13.840
and send a telegram to the Central Committee

768
35:13.840 --> 35:15.100
to state our attitude.

769
35:15.950 --> 35:17.790
We must urge the Central Committee to quickly resolve

770
35:17.790 --> 35:19.480
the organizational issue of military command.

771
35:19.480 --> 35:20.120
Yes.

772
35:20.350 --> 35:21.980
We can't drag this on any longer.

773
35:21.980 --> 35:24.660
I will send a telegram to the Central Committee in my own name

774
35:24.660 --> 35:25.910
to express my views.

775
35:36.650 --> 35:37.290
I know that

776
35:37.830 --> 35:39.560
everything everyone is saying

777
35:39.620 --> 35:41.870
is for the good of our 4th Front Army.

778
35:42.390 --> 35:43.450
I also believe that

779
35:43.710 --> 35:45.190
the Central Committee and the Military Commission

780
35:45.190 --> 35:47.320
will understand our good intentions.

781
35:57.360 --> 36:01.320
[Chazhen Liangzi Pass, Sichuan]

782
36:36.660 --> 36:38.710
That book from the chieftain?

783
36:43.180 --> 36:43.910
Yes.

784
36:45.020 --> 36:46.280
I didn't expect to find

785
36:46.650 --> 36:49.000
in the Tibetan chieftain's house

786
36:49.620 --> 36:51.820
a copy of Romance of the Three Kingdoms.

787
36:52.460 --> 36:54.750
It's quite interesting.

788
37:00.560 --> 37:02.220
Which chapter are you on?

789
37:04.450 --> 37:09.980
Yielding Xuzhou or borrowing Jingzhou?

790
37:11.790 --> 37:13.590
I couldn't take in a single word.

791
37:17.350 --> 37:18.550
Don't worry about it.

792
37:18.800 --> 37:20.060
You still have a fever.

793
37:20.690 --> 37:21.810
Keep resting.

794
37:25.230 --> 37:26.710
Interestingly,

795
37:27.390 --> 37:28.790
the owner of this copy of

796
37:28.790 --> 37:30.980
Romance of the Three Kingdoms borrowed by Mao Zedong,

797
37:30.980 --> 37:33.110
the Zhuokeji Chieftain Suo Guanying,

798
37:33.660 --> 37:35.140
in the following years,

799
37:35.140 --> 37:37.610
chose to stand with the people,

800
37:38.620 --> 37:40.870
contributing to the peaceful liberation

801
37:40.870 --> 37:42.540
of the Zhuokeji area.

802
37:43.540 --> 37:44.750
In 1952,

803
37:45.100 --> 37:46.750
as a member of the Southwest Ethnic Minority

804
37:46.750 --> 37:48.750
Visiting Group, Suo Guanying

805
37:48.900 --> 37:52.010
was received by Mao Zedong in Beijing.

806
37:52.580 --> 37:53.420
It is said that

807
37:53.660 --> 37:55.260
Mao Zedong not only recalled

808
37:55.260 --> 37:56.730
this scene from the past,

809
37:57.310 --> 37:59.660
but also presented a new set of Romance of the Three Kingdoms

810
37:59.660 --> 38:00.920
to Suo Guanying.

811
38:04.410 --> 38:05.740
Telegram from Lin Biao.

812
38:08.760 --> 38:09.600
Mao.

813
38:10.310 --> 38:11.640
Telegram from Lin Biao.

814
38:12.270 --> 38:14.600
The vanguard of the Left Route Army in Mao'ergai

815
38:14.600 --> 38:16.210
has engaged Hu Zongnan's

816
38:16.240 --> 38:17.120
reinforced Battalion.

817
38:17.120 --> 38:18.830
However, the Central and Right Route Armies

818
38:18.830 --> 38:20.250
have just left Lifan and Maoxian,

819
38:20.250 --> 38:21.430
making it very difficult to complete

820
38:21.430 --> 38:22.500
the established deployment

821
38:22.500 --> 38:23.980
in the "Songpan Campaign Plan."

822
38:23.980 --> 38:25.140
Their troops are slow,

823
38:25.140 --> 38:26.580
but their telegrams are fast.

824
38:26.580 --> 38:28.380
From yesterday to this morning,

825
38:28.430 --> 38:29.580
the CPC Sichuan-Shaanxi Provincial Committee

826
38:29.580 --> 38:30.660
has continuously sent several telegrams

827
38:30.660 --> 38:32.120
to the Central Committee,

828
38:32.170 --> 38:34.270
demanding a quick resolution to

829
38:34.460 --> 38:36.760
the organizational issue of the Red Army's command.

830
38:36.760 --> 38:38.580
A mere Sichuan-Shaanxi Provincial Committee

831
38:38.580 --> 38:41.820
dares to directly interfere with the Central Committee's personnel arrangements.

832
38:41.820 --> 38:43.670
It's unbelievable and outrageous!

833
38:43.670 --> 38:45.500
They signed as the Sichuan-Shaanxi Provincial Committee,

834
38:45.500 --> 38:46.980
but the wording is blatantly

835
38:46.980 --> 38:49.140
in Zhang Guotao's tone!

836
38:49.160 --> 38:51.330
This is just Zhang Guotao's petty trick.

837
38:51.330 --> 38:52.990
We absolutely cannot agree to

838
38:53.100 --> 38:56.490
this so-called proposal from the Sichuan-Shaanxi Provincial Committee.

839
38:56.490 --> 38:58.340
But if we disagree,

840
38:58.760 --> 39:00.910
it will give them an excuse to create a dispute

841
39:00.910 --> 39:02.910
between the Central Committee and the local provincial committee.

842
39:02.910 --> 39:05.910
Zhang Guotao will definitely make a big fuss about it.

843
39:12.180 --> 39:13.230
Comrade Zedong.

844
39:15.390 --> 39:20.020
How do you want to handle Zhang Guotao's issue?

845
39:30.060 --> 39:30.600
Wait.

846
39:32.830 --> 39:33.760
We can only wait.

847
39:36.430 --> 39:38.030
Wait for him to show his hand.

848
39:58.320 --> 39:59.720
Once we cross this ridge,

849
40:00.620 --> 40:03.880
the Central Red Army will move from the Yangtze River basin

850
40:04.020 --> 40:05.620
into the Yellow River basin.

851
40:08.580 --> 40:10.620
At this time, no one expected that

852
40:11.180 --> 40:14.240
Zhang Guotao's flip-flopping was just the beginning,

853
40:14.750 --> 40:16.750
and a greater test was yet to come.

854
40:18.230 --> 40:19.660
Just like the boundary marker

855
40:19.660 --> 40:21.710
the central leaders passed,

856
40:22.100 --> 40:25.270
after the Party and the Red Army temporarily escaped the military threat

857
40:25.270 --> 40:27.750
of encirclement and interception by the KMT troops,

858
40:27.750 --> 40:29.600
the struggle against Zhang Guotao

859
40:29.600 --> 40:32.800
became a new watershed during the Long March.

860
40:34.620 --> 40:35.950
Just when Zhang Guotao reached out

861
40:35.950 --> 40:38.180
to demand power from the Central Committee,

862
40:38.180 --> 40:40.180
across the vast land of China,

863
40:40.430 --> 40:42.870
several other Red Army armed forces

864
40:42.870 --> 40:45.830
that had lost contact with the Central Committee still held on to their beliefs,

865
40:45.830 --> 40:49.230
surviving and developing tenaciously in bitter struggles.

866
40:49.270 --> 40:51.070
In the Shaanxi and Gansu region,

867
40:51.140 --> 40:53.160
after the establishment of the Northwest Working Committee of the CPC

868
40:53.160 --> 40:55.690
and the Northwest Military Commission,

869
40:56.190 --> 40:58.980
the 26th and 27th Red Armies,

870
40:59.000 --> 41:01.780
under the unified command of Liu Zhidan and others,

871
41:01.780 --> 41:03.390
smashed the Kuomintang Army's

872
41:03.390 --> 41:06.350
second encirclement and suppression campaign against the Shaanxi and Gansu base area,

873
41:06.350 --> 41:08.800
and established Soviet regimes in more than 20 counties and districts

874
41:08.800 --> 41:10.680
in the Shaanxi and Gansu region.

875
41:10.990 --> 41:14.060
The guerrilla zone were expanded to more than 30 counties,

876
41:14.060 --> 41:17.240
and the main force of the Red Army grew to over 5,000 people,

877
41:17.240 --> 41:19.900
connecting the two base areas of the Shaanxi-Gansu border

878
41:19.900 --> 41:21.630
and northern Shaanxi into one.

879
41:23.760 --> 41:26.050
Located on the border of Hunan-Hubei-Sichuan-Guizhou,

880
41:26.050 --> 41:27.710
the 2nd and 6th Red Army Corps,

881
41:27.750 --> 41:29.430
as the only main Red Army force

882
41:29.430 --> 41:30.790
in southern China,

883
41:30.950 --> 41:33.980
in order to coordinate with the strategic shift of the Central Red Army,

884
41:33.980 --> 41:35.660
after completing the western Hunan offensive,

885
41:35.660 --> 41:36.910
fought continuously

886
41:37.210 --> 41:40.680
and smashed Chiang Kai-shek's large-scale encirclement and suppression campaign

887
41:40.680 --> 41:42.440
against the Hunan-Hubei-Sichuan-Guizhou Soviet Area.

888
41:42.440 --> 41:44.700
The base area bordered Wuhan to the north

889
41:44.770 --> 41:46.230
and Changsha to the south,

890
41:46.660 --> 41:48.060
and the main forces of the two corps

891
41:48.060 --> 41:50.350
grew to more than 21,000 people.

892
41:52.260 --> 41:53.300
At the same time,

893
41:53.790 --> 41:55.140
the 25th Red Army,

894
41:55.160 --> 41:56.500
which had lost contact with the Central Committee,

895
41:56.500 --> 41:59.100
after more than eight months of fighting alone,

896
41:59.100 --> 42:02.500
created the Hubei-Henan-Shaanxi revolutionary base area,

897
42:02.500 --> 42:04.660
and the number of troops grew from

898
42:04.660 --> 42:05.790
less than 3,000 at the time of departure

899
42:05.790 --> 42:07.230
to more than 4,000.

900
42:07.870 --> 42:10.180
On July 16, 1935,

901
42:10.310 --> 42:13.540
the main force advanced westward along the northern part of the Qinling Mountains,

902
42:13.540 --> 42:16.610
embarking on a new journey of marching west to Gansu and north to northern Shaanxi

903
42:16.610 --> 42:20.470
to strive for the consolidation of the Shaanxi and Gansu Soviet Area.

904
42:21.140 --> 42:22.950
Xiang Ying, Chen Yi, and others,

905
42:22.950 --> 42:24.950
who broke out of the Central Soviet Area

906
42:24.950 --> 42:27.050
to the Youshan area on the border of Jiangxi and Guangdong,

907
42:27.050 --> 42:29.740
were facing a huge crisis at this time.

908
42:30.460 --> 42:33.420
The troops lived in hardship, suffered severe casualties,

909
42:33.420 --> 42:35.900
and their morale also suffered a major blow.

910
42:36.340 --> 42:37.500
Facing the predicament,

911
42:37.500 --> 42:39.540
Xiang Ying and Chen Yi determined the policy of

912
42:39.540 --> 42:41.670
relying on the masses, persisting in the struggle,

913
42:41.670 --> 42:42.790
accumulating strength,

914
42:42.790 --> 42:44.050
creating conditions,

915
42:44.060 --> 42:46.660
and welcoming the new upsurge of the revolution.

916
42:46.660 --> 42:48.100
Centered on Youshan,

917
42:48.140 --> 42:50.490
in Xinfeng, Ganxian,

918
42:50.520 --> 42:51.940
Longnan, and Shangyou in Jiangxi,

919
42:51.940 --> 42:53.500
and the Nanxiong area in Guangdong,

920
42:53.500 --> 42:55.630
they persisted in guerrilla warfare.

921
42:56.260 --> 43:00.070
[Outer defenses of Songpan County, Sichuan]

922
42:57.900 --> 43:00.500
How many times has the Communist Army charged?

923
43:00.560 --> 43:01.820
This is the ninth time.

924
43:01.950 --> 43:03.430
The fighting will of the Communist Army

925
43:03.430 --> 43:04.580
is terrifying.
